/-!
# Weak-closure bounds in the abelian amalgam case

The imported development proves both conditional implications in 15.3.63,
constructing the hyperplane contradiction from the actual action. It also
provides the shared local quotient action, the field-parity implication, and
the extended-natural deduction of r=2 from the minimal-member assertion.

The verification of F.9.8 and the bound in 15.3.64, and the component/module
argument establishing 15.3.65(1), remain necessary for final assembly here.
In particular, the conditional r=2 helper does not assert that its n(H)=1
premise has been proved.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript (1 March 2004),
printed pp.1151–1152.
-/
